OL,3,GNEWSACouncil sets out plan for food
OL,4,Awaste collections
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharnwood Borough Council has said it
OL,7,Fwill introduce food waste collections
OL,8,Ffor the majority of households later
OL,9,Fthis year.
OL,11,FThe authority expects the service to
OL,12,Fbegin for most homes from 2 November.
OL,14,FCollections for households with
OL,15,Fcommunal bin store areas, including
OL,16,Fblocks of flats and shared
OL,17,Faccommodation, are scheduled to start
OL,18,Fin 2027, the council added.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
