OL,3,GNEWSACouncil sets out plan for food
OL,4,Awaste collections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service is being introduced as part
OL,7,Fof the government's Simpler Recycling
OL,8,Freforms, which require all councils in
OL,9,FEngland to collect food waste
OL,10,Fseparately.
